                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This morning I joined Marshall Health in celebrating the grand opening of their expanded facility at the Strayer Building in Teays Valley. I was honored to secure funding for this project, bringing a new academic toxicology lab, health clinics, and a dermatology suite to Putnam County.",
