                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, I joined the West Virginia School of Osteopathic Medicine in officially breaking ground on the Fredric W. Smith Science Building expansion project. \n\nThis expansion will tremendously support student and faculty research by more than doubling the size of the existing building. I was happy to support funding for this project to ensure tomorrow\u2019s physicians have the resources they need to best serve our communities.",
