                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Alcon\u2019s new $60 million expansion here in Cabell County is an incredible testament to our workforce and a major investment into our local economy. \n\nI was happy to visit Alcon last year to discuss this project and hear about the tremendous work they do in the eye health industry improving vision for cataract patients.",
