                "text": "The new Marco Mobile Medicine Unit is now in service! I was happy to support this project and secure federal funds to help bring it to fruition. \n\nThe Marshall Health Network and the Joan C. Edwards School of Medicine are doing incredible work providing quality healthcare to our rural communities.",
