                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was wonderful to join Tammy Norville, CEO of the National Organization of State Offices of Rural Health, for the annual National Rural Health Day Celebration this morning in D.C. \n\nAs a member of the Health Subcommittee from the rural state of West Virginia, ensuring access to quality care regardless of one\u2019s zip code remains my top priority.",
