                "text": "I am continuing to pray for our two West Virginia National Guard members, Sarah Beckstrom and Andrew Wolfe, who are receiving medical care after being shot while on duty in Washington, DC yesterday. \n\nPlease join me in praying for these Guard members, their families, and for their fellow service members. May God bless the brave men and women serving our country. \n\n\u201cBlessed are the peacemakers, for they will be called children of God.\u201d -Matthew 5:9",
